==Strategy==
Although [[Li'l Homura (Special Cat)|Li'l Homura]] may not be deployed in this stage, having her in the lineup will still trigger [[My Very Best Friend (Combo)|My Very Best Friend]], which makes this stage a complete joke. You just have to put out [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|Li'l Ultimate Madoka]] and some meatshields.

